    "promotion_window": "August 1, 2025 through December 15, 2025",
    "posting": "Typically after the qualifying period closes and transactions clear"
  },
  "comparison": {
    "personal_cards": "I found no currently published personal points or cash-back sign-up offer exceeding the EcoCard's 2,000-point bonus.",
    "business_card_alternative": "The Business Bronze Rewards Card offers a $500 statement credit after $10,000 in spending within the first two months, with a $0 annual fee. It is only available for business applicants."
  },
  "bottom_line": "If you are applying personally and can comfortably meet the $5,000 first-month spending requirement, the EcoCard is the best promotional offer based on reward value. If avoiding the annual fee is more important than maximizing the bonus, the Business Bronze offer is better—but only if you qualify as a business applicant."
